OL,3,GNEWSADeath of man found at disused tram
OL,4,Astop 'unexplained'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe death of a man whose body was found
OL,7,Fat a disused tram stop in Leicester is
OL,8,Fbeing treated by police as
OL,9,F"unexplained".
OL,11,FLeicestershire Police said it was
OL,12,Fcalled at 10:44 GMT on Wednesday to
OL,13,FFosse Road North alongside East
OL,14,FMidlands Ambulance Service.
OL,16,FThe man was pronounced dead at the
OL,17,Fscene, police added.
OL,19,FThe force said the death was not being
OL,20,Ftreated as suspicious but unexplained,
OL,21,Fadding a file would be prepared for the
OL,22,Fcoroner.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
